The `choosing Camera mode picks a camera so Start stays available` e2e test timed out on a loaded machine: the mode menu could close while the panel resized, and the click on **Camera only** then waited on an option that was no longer there.

```ts
const modeSelect = panel.getByRole("combobox").first();
await expect(async () => {
	if (!(await modeSelect.textContent())?.includes("Camera")) {
		await modeSelect.click({ timeout: 2_000 });
		await panel.getByRole("option", { name: "Camera only" }).click({ timeout: 2_000 });
	}
	await expect(modeSelect).toContainText("Camera", { timeout: 1_000 });
}).toPass({ timeout: 30_000 });
```

- Reopens the menu until the mode reads Camera, then makes the same Start and saved-camera assertions as before.
